 *** WARNING [props.dump] the property operators L and S carry NO picture-change transformation : they are the bare non-relativistic AO operators used unchanged in the two-component basis. This matches OpenMolcas RASSI, so a cross-code comparison is like-for-like. The approximation has been measured and is small: below 0.3% on every free-ion multiplet g factor from Z=5 to Z=81, 0.02% on a 3d complex's ground doublet, and it splits no degeneracy at all. It is recorded in the header of boron_none.props

